  "finding": "All three independently verified original archives show the previously live session shell absent from /proc immediately after successful adb root and confirmed root UID/boot. The continuity guard rejects before the wrapper proceeds to its application installation and tours.",
  "limitations": [
    "The post-root snapshot aborts at the session-shell stat. It never observes the later logcat child PID, so the child disappearance and the exact terminating signal/cgroup cause are not independently demonstrated.",
    "The framework PASS is a sampled pre-app readiness observation only. No API37 app, input, speech, renderer comparison or update acceptance was reached.",
    "Original candidate run failure is preserved; only its successful build and actual unchanged APK/PCK/source bindings are established here.",
    "API35 and update jobs remain separate ongoing observations at this snapshot."
  ],
